1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:07,083
苗栗通霄的海邊，有一座面海的小廟：白沙屯拱天宮。
<i>On the coast of Tongxiao, Miaoli, stands a seaside temple: Baishatun Gongtian Temple.</i>

2
00:00:07,383 --> 00:00:12,817
每年春天，這裡的媽祖要徒步南下，前往北港進香。
<i>Every spring, its Mazu sets out on foot, south to Beigang, on pilgrimage.</i>

3
00:00:21,817 --> 00:00:27,317
出發的日子不由人決定，而是在神前擲筊，請示媽祖。
<i>The departure date is not set by people, but asked of Mazu by casting moon blocks.</i>

4
00:00:27,617 --> 00:00:32,450
筊杯一聲聲落地，進香的日期與時辰就此定下。
<i>As the blocks clatter to the floor, the day and hour of the pilgrimage are fixed.</i>

5
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:40,617
深夜時分，媽祖登轎，神轎在鞭炮聲中走出廟門。
<i>Late at night, Mazu mounts her palanquin, which leaves the temple amid firecrackers.</i>

6
00:00:40,917 --> 00:00:45,883
頭旗在前開路，成千上萬的香燈腳緊緊跟隨。
<i>The lead banner clears the way, and tens of thousands of pilgrims follow close behind.</i>

7
00:00:48,383 --> 00:00:53,983
這趟進香沒有固定路線，往哪裡走，全憑媽祖指引。
<i>There is no fixed route. Where to go is left entirely to Mazu's guidance.</i>

8
00:00:54,283 --> 00:01:00,117
來回約三、四百公里，走過苗栗、臺中、彰化與雲林。
<i>The round trip, some 300 to 400 km, crosses Miaoli, Taichung, Changhua and Yunlin.</i>

9
00:01:02,617 --> 00:01:08,350
神轎覆著粉紅色遮雨布，走得又快，人稱「粉紅超跑」。
<i>Draped in a pink rain cover and moving fast, the palanquin is nicknamed the "Pink Supercar".</i>

10
00:01:08,650 --> 00:01:13,717
四人扛的小轎輕巧靈活，時而大步，時而小跑。
<i>Carried by four, the light sedan is nimble: striding one moment, jogging the next.</i>

11
00:01:16,217 --> 00:01:22,517
二〇〇一年，神轎曾突然轉向，帶領信徒涉水渡過濁水溪。
<i>In 2001, the palanquin suddenly turned and led followers wading across the Zhuoshui River.</i>

12
00:01:25,017 --> 00:01:30,183
沿途居民擺出茶水點心，招待素不相識的香燈腳。
<i>Villagers along the way set out tea and snacks for pilgrims they have never met.</i>

13
00:01:30,483 --> 00:01:36,150
信徒跪伏路旁，等待神轎從身上經過，祈求平安。
<i>Believers kneel by the road, waiting for the palanquin to pass over them, praying for peace.</i>

14
00:01:38,650 --> 00:01:43,083
抵達北港朝天宮後，舉行最神聖的「刈火」儀式。
<i>At Beigang's Chaotian Temple, the most sacred rite is held: gathering the fire.</i>

15
00:01:43,383 --> 00:01:48,483
萬年香爐的香火被舀入火缸，封存後帶回白沙屯。
<i>Embers from the ancient censer are ladled into a fire urn, sealed, and carried home.</i>

16
00:01:50,983 --> 00:01:56,683
回程風雨兼程，沿路人家點起燈火，迎接媽祖回家。
<i>On the long road back, families light lamps along the way to welcome Mazu home.</i>

17
00:01:56,983 --> 00:02:01,950
回宮那一刻，眾人高喊「進喔」，煙火照亮夜空。
<i>At the moment she re-enters the temple, the crowd cries "Jin-oh!" as fireworks light the sky.</i>

18
00:02:04,450 --> 00:02:10,083
這項傳統延續近兩百年，二〇一〇年列為國家重要民俗。
<i>Nearly two centuries old, the tradition became a National Important Folk Custom in 2010.</i>

19
00:02:10,383 --> 00:02:14,517
二〇二六年，報名人數超過四十六萬人。
<i>In 2026, more than 460,000 people registered to walk.</i>

20
00:02:14,817 --> 00:02:19,817
從幾百人到數十萬人，走的是同一份虔誠與感恩。
<i>From a few hundred to hundreds of thousands, they walk with the same devotion and gratitude.</i>

21
00:02:20,117 --> 00:02:25,483
媽祖走在前面，我們跟在後面，一步一步，走回家。
<i>Mazu walks ahead, and we follow behind, step by step, all the way home.</i>

